    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Number 30 Altamont Hall is a beautifully presented two-bedroom, two-bathroom apartment extending to approximately 79 sq.m / 850 sq.ft. Set within a small, mature, and exclusive development just off Stoney Road in Dundrum, this immaculately maintained and upgraded ground floor home is tastefully finished and offers quality accommodation in a prime Dublin location—close to Dundrum Town Centre, the LUAS, UCD, and a host of amenities—the property will appeal to both owner-occupiers and investors alike.\r\n\r\nUpon entering, you are greeted by a spacious L-shaped hallway with a large hot press doubling as a practical storage room. To the rear lies the main living area, and a modern kitchen offering a range of appliances and ample storage space. The welcoming living space includes an attractive stone fireplace with an electric coal-effect fire and flows seamlessly into the well-proportioned kitchen. \r\n\r\nThe apartment comprises two double bedrooms: the first is exceptionally spacious, complete with built-in wardrobes and a stylish and modern ensuite bathroom. The second double bedroom, almost as spacious as the master, also includes built-in wardrobes for ease and practicality of storage. The main bathroom with an electric shower, with top-quality finishes, completes the accommodation. The property also benefits from one designated underground parking space with remote-control access.\r\n\r\nAltamont Hall is a peaceful, leafy, low-rise development located just a short stroll from Dundrum Village and Dundrum Town Centre, with its array of cafés, restaurants, shops, cinema, and theatre. Transport options are excellent, with the Dundrum LUAS stop mere moments away, offering swift access to the city centre, Sandyford Business Park, and the Beacon Hospital. The M50 and N11 (QBC) are also easily accessible for travel further afield.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "HALL (L – Shaped)\r\n3.26m x 1.24m + 3.98m x 0.98m\r\nEngineered Walnut flooring, pendant lighting, Intercom.\r\n\r\nHOT PRESS / STORAGE ROOM\r\n2.12m x 1.51m\r\nEngineered Walnut flooring, pendant lighting. Hot water tank & immersion. Built-in shelving providing ample storage space.\r\n\r\nLIVING / DINING AREA\r\n5.05m x 3.85m (Main) + 2.27m x 0.93m (Bay)\r\nEngineered walnut flooring, Feature stone fireplace with an electric coal effect fire. Ceiling coving and Ceiling fan. Bay window area with double glazed windows & fitted blinds.\r\n\r\nKITCHEN\r\n3.18m x 2.08m\r\nKitchen area with wall and base units with a black worktop and tiled splashback and a stainless-steel sink unit and drainer. Engineered walnut flooring and pendant lighting. Quality appliances to include a Zanussi oven and four ring electric hob, and Delmore extractor hood. Double glazed windows.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 1\r\n4.89m x 3.16m (Main) + 1.80m x 0.91m (Entry) + 1.97m x 0.41m (Bay)\r\nFully carpeted with ceiling coving and pendant lighting. Double fitted wardrobes with shelving and hanging space. Ensuite bathroom. Bay window area with double glazed windows and fitted blinds.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 2\r\n3.97m x 2.96m\r\nFully carpeted with ceiling coving and pendant lighting. Fitted wardrobes with shelving and hanging space. Double glazed windows with fitted blinds.\r\n\r\nMAIN BATHROOM\r\n2.09m x 1.71m\r\nTiled flooring and part tiled walls with tiled shower cubicle and glass enclosure with Triton T90Z electric shower. Wash hand basin, W.C., wall mounted mirrors, wall mounted towel rack with extractor fan and wall mounted Creda electric heater.\r\n\r\nENSUITE\r\n2.51m x 2.17m\r\nTiled flooring and part tiled walls. Bath with shower attachment and tiled enclosure with shower curtain. Wash hand basin, W.C., wall mounted mirrors. Extractor fan and wall mounted Creda electric heater. Underfloor heating."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\tBright and spacious ground floor apartment extending to c. 79 sq.m / 850 sq.ft\r\n•\tTwo large double bedrooms and two modern bathrooms\r\n•\tDouble-glazed windows throughout with electric storage heating\r\n•\tOne designated underground parking space\r\n•\tWell maintained landscaped communal grounds\r\n•\tSecure bike shed for residents\r\n•\tAdjacent to numerous amenities including Dundrum Town Centre\r\n•\tLUAS Green Line (Dundrum) stop just a 5-minute walk away\r\n•\tExcellent transport links including Luas, M50 and N11"
      },
